From f1eb34ae06143f9c74912bdae4594951050bbef3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=9CDeepak?= <kudee@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 15:09:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] plat-qcom: nord: enable HPASS0-2/NSPSS0-3 PAS support
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add Nord PAS platform support for the HPASS0-2 and NSPSS0-3 remote processors.
Register the NSPSS and HPASS subsystem  with their PAS IDs, base addresses,
clock groups, reset sequencing and enable them for fw_start operations.

Signed-off-by: “Deepak <kudee@qti.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
